//  🛑 v2.11.0 - THESE TWO ARE NOW OWNED, NOT REFERENCED, and the note above that
//  says owning them is dangerous was written under a belief §50 later measured to
//  be BACKWARDS. It said mod.ff's copy would replace Origins' Ray Gun textures
//  with Mob's; §50 proved the MAP's copy wins, so on Origins, Mob and Buried
//  mod.ff's copies are inert and each map keeps its own art exactly as before.
//  They have to be owned because ray_gun_upgraded_zm now ships Buried's def on
//  every map, and t6_wpn_zmb_raygun_view_upg / _world_upg use these two of their
//  five materials - and NEITHER exists in zm_transit.ff, zm_highrise.ff or
//  zm_nuked.ff. Left as references the upgraded Ray Gun would have drawn with
//  two missing materials on exactly the three maps this whole change is for.
//  Their three images (ray_gun_n, ~-gray_gun, ~~-gray_gun_s-rgb...) were checked
//  and DO exist on all three, so the map still supplies the pixels.
material,mc/mtl_t6_wpn_zmb_raygun
material,mc/mtl_t6_wpn_zmb_raygun_camo
