// ============================================================================
//  BURIED GHOST (the Witch) - load-time support only
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  Per the Unlinker, animtrees/zm_buried_ghost.atr and its .asd exist ONLY in
//  so_zclassic/so_zencounter_zm_buried.ff. "unknown anim tree" is a fatal
//  COM_ERROR that cannot be guarded around in script. No ghost spawner entity
//  ships in this mod's mapents, so no witch ever spawns on Borough survival -
//  these four entries only keep every load-time reference resolvable, matching
//  the configuration that booted 2026-08-02.
// ============================================================================
rawfile,animtrees/zm_buried_ghost.atr
rawfile,animstatedefs/zm_buried_ghost.asd
script,aitype/zm_buried_ghost_female.gsc
script,character/c_zom_zombie_buried_ghost_woman.gsc

// ============================================================================
//  BURIED BASIC ZOMBIES  -  fixes "no zombies spawn on Borough".
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  On Buried under zstandard there are no AI spawner entities in the world at
//  all: the 9 "zombie_spawner" entities live in the so_zclassic/so_zencounter
//  ADDONMAPENTS (an asset type the Unlinker cannot export - the T6-Data-Archive
//  extraction settles it), and there is no so_zsurvival_zm_buried.ff. So
//  _zm_spawner::init builds an empty level.zombie_spawners and round_spawning
//  dies silently on its first iteration.
//
//  BO2-Reimagined solves this by moving the spawner entities into the BASE map
//  entities, which every gametype loads - its maps\mp\zm_buried.d3dbsp carries
//  the 9 actor_zm_buried_basic_* blocks. This project now does the same (the
//  blocks are appended to maps\mp\zm_buried.d3dbsp, byte-for-byte Reimagined's,
//  packed into mod.iwd - entities need no zone entry). This mirrors what the
//  project already ships for Alcatraz (2 actors) and Die Rise (5).
//
//  The ASSETS those nine aitypes need are declared here. Every name was
//  verified present in so_zclassic_zm_buried.ff (build_ff.bat --loads it, so
//  the Linker copies them out of it).
// ============================================================================
rawfile,animtrees/zm_buried_basic.atr
rawfile,animstatedefs/zm_buried_basic.asd

script,aitype/zm_buried_basic_03.gsc
script,aitype/zm_buried_basic_01_char_01.gsc
